<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72745" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀκέλλω</span></b> ,=<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέλλω,</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>Ach.</u>
			1159
		</span></i> : impf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὤκελλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.84
				</span></i>
			 : aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὤκειλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.11
				</span></i>
			 : </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> trans. of
			seamen, <i>run</i> [a ship] <i>aground</i> or <i>on shore,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς νέας</span> Hdt.l.c., Th.l.c. ; of a
			wave, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				1379
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλόον ὀ.</span>
			<i>steer</i> one's course, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				295
			</span></i> : metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στίβον ὀ.</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				321
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr. of the
			ship, <i>run aground,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.91
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				7.5.12
			</span></i> : metaph., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
			</span></i> l.c. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλγημα . . ἐς γλουτὸν ἢ ὀσφὺν
					ὀκέλλει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SD</u>
					2.12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>CA</u>
				2.7
			</span></i>.—Prose writers use <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀκέλλω,</span> never <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέλλω</span>
			(q. v.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
